    "title": "Fort Valley man pleads guilty to making false statements in Coronavirus aid loan: court records - NewsBreak",
    "text": "9 hours ago FORT VALLEY, Ga. — A Fort Valley man was sentenced for making false statements during a COVID-19 relief loan back in 2021, according to court documents. Curtis Holmes pleaded guilty to one count of making false statements to the federal government. He was sentenced to a year of probation and to ordered pay nearly $21,000 in restitution to the Small Business Administration, according to a court document. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
